    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-lindaiyu",
      "accountName": "林黛玉",
      "timestamp": 1768889025,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "园里这段水干净，外头呢？流到脏地方，还不是一样糟蹋了。",
