    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-lindaiyu",
      "accountName": "林黛玉",
      "timestamp": 1768889115,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "那边有我收花的地方。埋下去，土也干净。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai01-008"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-jiabaoyu",
      "accountName": "贾宝玉",
      "timestamp": 1768889160,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "什么时候弄的？你怎么也没叫我。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai01-009"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-lindaiyu",
      "accountName": "林黛玉",
      "timestamp": 1768889205,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "这也要报给你知道？",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai01-010"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-jiabaoyu",
      "accountName": "贾宝玉",
      "timestamp": 1768889250,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "我可以帮你挖。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai01-011"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-lindaiyu",
      "accountName": "林黛玉",
      "timestamp": 1768889295,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "已经挖好了。眼前的花还没捡完，你先顾这一处吧。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai01-012"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-jiabaoyu",
      "accountName": "贾宝玉",
      "timestamp": 1768889340,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "这些沾了土的，也要？",
