    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-lindaiyu",
      "accountName": "林黛玉",
      "timestamp": 1768891050,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "这几句倒真写得好。话像随口说的，意思都在里头。",
