    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-jiabaoyu",
      "accountName": "贾宝玉",
      "timestamp": 1768891095,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "我说什么来着。你若是书里那位小姐——",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai02-012"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-lindaiyu",
      "accountName": "林黛玉",
      "timestamp": 1768891140,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "你又拿我比什么？",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai02-013"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-jiabaoyu",
      "accountName": "贾宝玉",
      "timestamp": 1768891185,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "我是说，你也这样会说话。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai02-014"
