    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-lindaiyu",
      "accountName": "林黛玉",
      "timestamp": 1769068980,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "你倒忽然又惜花了。那天一兜往水里倒的时候，怎么不见你这样。",
