    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-jiabaoyu",
      "accountName": "贾宝玉",
      "timestamp": 1769997690,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "什么闭门羹？",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai04-003"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-lindaiyu",
      "accountName": "林黛玉",
      "timestamp": 1769997735,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "昨晚我到你那里，门里说你吩咐了，谁来也不开。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-hongloumeng-v1-dai04-004"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-hongloumeng-jiabaoyu",
      "accountName": "贾宝玉",
      "timestamp": 1769997780,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "我什么时候说过？我连你来过都不知道。",
